Data Card:
Dataset Title: South-Eastern Melbourne Suburban Logistics Metrics
Overview: A spatial-statistical dataset mapping order volumes and fulfillment duration across South-East Melbourne suburban nodes.
Variables: Longitude & Latitude (WGS 84 spatial coordinates), Order_Volume (transaction counts per hub), Average_Delivery_Time_Min (fulfillment duration in minutes).
Limitations: Geographic points represent suburban centroid approximations rather than street-level parcel polygons.

